== Trivia ==
*There are 111 possible unique combinations of colors available in the '''Teleport Pad'''.
*There are ten locations in the world where teleport pads are found that are not on your private island: in the [[Community Center]] leading to the [[Election Room]], in the Election Room leading back to the Community Center during the [[Mayor Election]], to access the [[Security Hall]], in [[Marco the Painter]]'s Flower House in the [[Hub Island]], leading to the [[Canvas Room]], from the Canvas Room to the Flower House, the [[Dragon's Nest]], leading between the Obsidian Rock and the Spire, along with one leading to the peak, another to the end spire, [[The End]], leading to the [[Void Sepulture]], and one to the [[Snowball Fight Cave]].

